=2 Rhapsodies of Vanadiel
{p:Curio Vendor Moogles|Curio Vendor Moogle} will sell the {p:Key Item} reward once {k:"Rhapsody in Azure"} is obtained from {p:Rhapsodies of Vanadiel}.
=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to Naja. When presented an option, choose __Balrahn Way__.
* Go to {p:Balrahn Way} for another cutscene. When presented an option, choose __Where have you been__.
* Obtain a {i:Sutlac|Sutlac|5577} and head off to {z:Nashmau}.
* At (H-9) in {z:Nashmau}, another cutscene will take place.
** Choose __No, let's keep trying!__
** If you choose the wrong answer during the cutscene, you will need to wait for a new game day before repeating the cutscene.
* Trade a {i:Sutlac|Sutlac|5577} to {n:Totoroon}.
* Exit East to {z:Caedarva Mire} and go to (I-10). Check the ??? on the East side of the pond for a cutscene.
* Return to Naja to complete the quest.

